title: "RF-based UAV Behaviour Sensing using Explainable Machine Learning"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "RF-based UAV Behaviour Sensing using Explainable Machine Learning contributors"
abstract: "An RF-based UAV behaviour recognition framework that extracts behaviour-related features from passively received radio-frequency signals and identifies UAV operational states, providing sensing-layer information for future airspace monitoring, risk assessment, and autonomous regulation systems."
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-07-15
repository-code: "https://github.com/Andrewlsr/RF-based-UAV-Behavior-Sensing"
keywords:
  - UAV
  - RF sensing
  - IQ signal processing
  - explainable machine learning
  - flight-mode recognition
